\par \par \uc2 The information in this report is provided "as is" without any representation or warranty of any kind, and \uc2 Fitch\uc2  does not represent or warrant that the report or any of its contents will meet any of the requirements of a recipient of the report. A \uc2 Fitch\uc2  rating is an opinion as to the creditworthiness of a security. This opinion and reports made by \uc2 Fitch\uc2  are based on established criteria and methodologies that \uc2 Fitch\uc2  is continuously evaluating and updating. Therefore, ratings and reports are the collective work product of \uc2 Fitch\uc2  and no individual, or group of individuals, is solely responsible for a rating or a report. The rating does not address the risk of loss due to risks other than credit risk, unless such risk is specifically mentioned. \uc2 Fitch\uc2  is not engaged in the offer or sale of any security. All \uc2 Fitch\uc2  reports have shared authorship. Individuals identified in a \uc2 Fitch\uc2  report were involved in, but are not solely responsible for, the opinions stated therein. The individuals are named for contact\par \par \uc2 7 Oct 2020 13:59 ET  Press Release: \uc2 Fitch\uc2  Affirms Kuveyt Turk at 'B+'; -3-\par \par \uc2 purposes only. A report providing a \uc2 Fitch\uc2  rating is neither a prospectus nor a substitute for the information assembled, verified and presented to investors by the issuer and its agents in connection with the sale of the securities. Ratings may be changed or withdrawn at any time for any reason in the sole discretion of \uc2 Fitch\uc2 . \uc2 Fitch\uc2  does not provide investment advice of any sort. Ratings are not a recommendation to buy, sell, or hold any security. Ratings do not comment on the adequacy of market price, the suitability of any security for a particular investor, or the tax-exempt nature or taxability of payments made in respect to any security. \uc2 Fitch\uc2  receives fees from issuers, insurers, guarantors, other obligors, and underwriters