\par\par \b \uc2 How Turkey's former central bankers would dodge a crisis\b0\par\par\uc2 805 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 September 2020\par 14:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 * Record low lira, double-digit inflation pose dilemma\par \par \uc2 * President Erdogan has pressed for monetary stimulus\par \par \uc2 * Ex-policymakers say raise rates and get back to basics\par \par \uc2 By Nevzat Devranoglu and Jonathan Spicer\par \par \uc2 ANKARA, Sept 17 (Reuters) - Veterans of \uc2 Turkey's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  have some advice for today's policymakers, who are on the frontlines of Ankara's unorthodox battle against a record-low lira and the economic impact of coronavirus: raise interest rates now and get back to basics.\par \par \uc2 Four former policymakers, including a governor, told Reuters the bank must win back some credibility by moving to wrestle inflation down to target for the first time in nearly a decade.\par \par \uc2 The first step in heading off a possible crisis, they said, is setting aside back-door policy tools and using a meeting next week to formally raise the benchmark policy rate. That could slow a 20% drop in the lira which has put it among this year's worst-performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Analysts say a rate hike is unlikely, especially given President \uc2 Tayyip Erdogan\uc2 's repeated calls for cheaper credit and the sacking last summer of the previous \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief for ignoring instructions.\par \par \uc2 Under new governor \uc2 Murat Uysal\uc2 , the bank slashed rates to 8.25% from 24% in less than a year, and has held them there since May.\par \par \uc2 "The trend is going toward a one-man rule, so talking about \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  independence is absurd right now," said Bulent Gultekin, governor in 1993 and now a professor at \uc2 The Wharton School\uc2  in Philadelphia.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cannot alone reform overall Turkish economic policy. But in the meantime they can gain some time by raising rates to ensure, for now, there is no panic."\par \par \uc2 The bank did not immediately comment. Governor Uysal has previously said the bank has policy independence and that policy is in line with projections that inflation will soon start to slow.\par \par \uc2 EXTRAORDINARY TOOLS\par \par \uc2 Turkey's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  touched an all-time low this week beyond 7.5 per U.S. dollar, keeping imports expensive and inflation near 12% despite a sharp economic slowdown due to the coronavirus.\par \par \uc2 Analysts say the selloff has laid bare the limits of \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's costly \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to stabilise the lira. They calculate the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and state banks have sold some $120 billion in dollars since last year.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  have played a role this year in nearly halving gross \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has also bought record amounts of government bonds to backstop Ankara's fiscal response to the pandemic.\par \par \uc2 Hakan Kara, who was the bank's chief economist until last year, said extraordinary tools such as \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and tweaks to required reserves have been over-used and are now blunted.\par \par \uc2 "These should not be a substitute for the fundamental instrument, the policy rate," he said, adding the bank needs to "break the spiral" of confidence among citizens and investors.\par \par \uc2 Only two of six economists polled by Reuters expect a rate hike next week, while they are split on whether one will come by year end.\par \par \uc2 Uysal has said policy reflects expectations inflation will soon dip and that reserves naturally fluctuate. Finance Minister \uc2 Berat Albayrak\uc2  -- Erdogan's son-in-law -- has said the bank sometimes \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stabilise the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and that exporters benefit from some depreciation.\par \par \uc2 CRISIS WARNING\par \par \uc2 This month the lira has held mostly flat, thanks in part to indirect steps to tighten credit that have raised average funding costs to 10.3% from 7.3% in two months.\par \par \uc2 Yet last week ratings agency \uc2 Moody's\uc2  said Turkey is headed toward a balance-of-payments crisis and noted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's "unsuccessful attempts to defend the lira" have cut its buffer down to lows not seen in decades.\par \par \uc2 Fatih Ozatay, a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  vice president from 2001-2006, said reserves would not be a problem if the lira were free-floating and economic policy was on the right track.\par \par \uc2 "If there is a need for fixing, it is not only the duty of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. "I'd prefer a direct increase in the policy rate instead of raising the average funding rate."\par \par \uc2 Another former policymaker, Ibrahim Turhan, who has since helped found the opposition Future Party, said the competence and independence of the bank has eroded since 2016 when annual inflation last dipped below 7%, near its 5% target.\par \par \uc2 "There can be no inflation without the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's permission," he said. "It has to regain its independence before anything else."\par \par \uc2 (For a graphic of reserves, click here: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://tmsnrt.rs/3hwPI6l"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://tmsnrt.rs/3hwPI6l}}}\uc2  For inflation and rates, click here: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://tmsnrt.rs/2H8bIbd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://tmsnrt.rs/2H8bIbd}}}\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Nevzat Devranoglu and Jonathan Spicer; Additional reporting by Ezgi Erkoyun; Editing by Catherine Evans) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-9-17T13:43:47.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020200917eg9h02h9x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
