\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Turkish lira recovers from record low after bullish JPM note\b0\par\par\uc2 256 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 August 2020\par 15:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds gains, JPM note)\par \par \uc2 ISTANBUL, Aug 26 (Reuters) - The Turkish lira was up 0.5% on Wednesday after hitting a record low the day before, with analysts citing a \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  recommendation to buy the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a volatile month-long sell-off showed signs of losing steam.\par \par \uc2 The lira has lagged most other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year due to concerns over depleted \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, costly state \b \highlight22\uc2 FX interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sharply negative real interest rates.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's clash with Greece over offshore resources has also weighed over the last month.\par \par \uc2 But in their bullish note to clients, \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  technical analysts said they had observed a "clear loss" of selling momentum in the last two weeks and that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could rally, especially if it breaks below 7.189 versus the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The lira was at 7.3625 at 1233 GMT, versus a record intraday low of 7.407 touched on Tuesday. It earlier strengthened to 7.34 against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 The Wall Street bank said there was a "substantial risk" that the lira would strengthen more.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has shed nearly 19% of its value so far this year, prompting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to tighten money supply through back-door channels that analysts said have helped keep it relatively steady since around Aug. 10.\par \par \uc2 Istanbul's main BIST 100 index was flat. (Reporting by Ezgi Erkoyun and Can Sezer; Editing by Subhranshu Sahu, Jonathan Spicer and Jan Harvey) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-8-26T14:12:45.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020200826eg8q02a3l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
