\par\par \b \uc2 Turkey sold $44 bln reserves to boost lira this year - bankers, data\b0\par\par\uc2 492 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Mai 2020\par 16:20\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 LONDON, May 29 (Reuters) - Turkey's state banks sold about $44 billion of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the first four months of this year and some $77 billion since the beginning of 2019 to support the lira, according to \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data and the calculations of four bankers.\par \par \uc2 Two of the bankers estimated more selling took place in May to boost the Turkish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and offset an outflow of funds amid the coronavirus pandemic, bringing total sales this year to more than $50 billion.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 FX interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by state lenders have heightened investor concerns over a drop in Turkey's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  buffer as its economy tips into a sharp downturn.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's net \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves have fallen to as low as $26 billion this month, from $40 billion at the start of 2020.\par \par \uc2 The calculations and estimates are based on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's latest data. The bankers, who requested anonymity due to the sensitivity of the matter, previously estimated state banks sold at least $32 billion as of March.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment.\par \par \uc2 Its governor, \uc2 Murat Uysal\uc2 , said last month that fluctuations in reserves are normal and temporary in such periods of stress.\par \par \uc2 Finance Minister \uc2 Berat Albayrak\uc2  has said the bank may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to reduce volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The lira has outperformed most emerging market (EM) peers this year, even while it is down 15% against the dollar and hit a record low in May.\par \par \uc2 Adding to market concerns, Turkey's external debt obligations are nearly $170 billion over the next 12 months.\par \par \uc2 Hunting for extra foreign funding, the government this month sealed a deal with Qatar to triple a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap line to $15 billion, helping to raise the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's net \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to $32 billion last week.\par \par \uc2 Local swaps obscure the true level of reserves, analysts say. "But if they keep burning reserves at the current pace," the new funds from Qatar will also be indirectly spent to boost the lira, said \uc2 Cristian Maggio\uc2 , head of EM strategy at \uc2 TD Securities\uc2  in London.\par \par \uc2 Kerim Rota, a founding member of Turkey's new Future Party, which opposes President \uc2 Tayyip Erdogan\uc2 's ruling AK Party, said he calculated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  of more than $11 billion in April alone, and $77 billion in the last 16 months.\par \par \uc2 These "backdoor" \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  diminish \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's transparency and reputation, and turn away foreign investors, Rota, a former banker, said on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Separate \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed that official reserves fell by $16.6 billion in March, reflecting a steady outflow of foreign funds in the last few months. Foreigners' share of Turkish bonds is at near record lows.\par \par \uc2 Albayrak, who is Erdogan's son-in-law, said on May 5 that developing economies accumulate reserves in part "to provide liquidity to markets during such difficult times." (Editing by Andrew Cawthorne) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-5-29T15:20:14.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020200529eg5t02sru\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
