\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Erdogan gains emergency powers to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  more directly in the economy\b0\par\par\uc2 323 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Januar 2019\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2  is beefing up its defenses against a further deepening financial crisis six months after the collapse of the lira has affected the entire economy. Turkish President \uc2 Recep Tayyip Erdogan\uc2  has received emergency powers that allow him to act more broadly and directly in the economy when it is considered that the country's financial stability is threatened.\par \par \uc2 The allocation of these powers was favorably voted by Parliament on Wednesday and will allow the President to take all necessary steps in the event of a "negative development" that could contaminate the entire financial system.\par \par \uc2 Parliament also endorsed the formation of the Financial Stability and Development Commission, which will work to coordinate efforts against financial stability and security risks, and to start \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the approval of the President.\par \par \uc2 The country is thus strengthening its defenses against a further deepening financial crisis six months after the collapse of the lira has affected the entire economy.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg points out that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis, which has spread to many emerging countries, and the consequent increase in financing costs, are having as negative effects as the failed coup attempt two and a half years ago, which demanded that state be decreed by July of last year.\par \par \uc2 According to the law, the president is now authorized and is responsible for the "implementation of all measures that go beyond the powers" of the Financial Stability and Development Commission, which will be formed under the supervision of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Erdogan, known for his aversion to the interest rate hike by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , is thus taking on more powers in the economic sphere as Turkey moves toward its first recession in a decade.\par \par \uc2 The country is still suffering the effects of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis that the authorities attributed to a foreign conspiracy in the context of a diplomatic crisis with the United States.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020190117ef1h0089g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
