\par\par \b \uc2 *Turkey's Deputy Prime Minister Ali Babacan Speaks to CNBCe\b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Januar 2014\par 10:44\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 24 Jan 2014 04:44 EDT *Turkey's Babacan: Volatility in \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Markets 'Temporary'\par \par \uc2 24 Jan 2014 06:24 EDT  Turkey's Babacan: Volatility in \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Markets 'Temporary'\par \par \uc2 ISTANBUL--Turkey's Deputy Prime Minister Ali Babacan Friday sought to calm investors' nerves as the lira continued to weaken despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday, following a broad-based investor exodus from emerging markets.\par \par \uc2 "Volatililty in global markets has had an impact on [recent] \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves, but it is temporary...Our economy and financial system are resistant to the volatility in markets," Mr.Babacan told Turkish TV channel CNBCe in Davos.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Babacan, the most senior voice on economy in the government, said markets should only follow the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's statements on exchange rates. He urged investors to consider Turkey's long-term economic stability.\par \par \uc2 But his statements didn't help the lira recover. The Turkish lira Friday weakened to a new record low of 2.32 against the dollar in line with a broader selloff in emerging markets, reflecting both the U.S. Federal Reserve's decision to scale back its monthly bond purchases as well as domestic political risks.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday directly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets for the first time in two years, but failed to stem the lira's slide.\par \par \uc2 Write to Yeliz Candemir at yeliz.candemir@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 January 24, 2014 06:24 ET (11:24 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020140124ea1o000ww\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw145\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2175\pichgoal600
