\par\par \b \uc2 Turkey - Factors to Watch on Jan 24\b0\par\par\uc2 332 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Januar 2014\par 07:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2014 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 ISTANBUL, Jan 24 (Reuters) - Here are news, reports and events that may affect Turkish financial markets on Friday.\par \par \uc2 Turkey's lira weakened to 2.2960 against the dollar by 0612 GMT from 2.289 late on Thursday. It touched a record low of 2.3050 on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The yield on the 10-year benchmark bond rose to 10.37 percent from 10.10 percent a day earlier.\par \par \uc2 The main Istanbul stock index closed down 2.88 percent at 65,429.29 points, underperforming the main global emerging market index .MSCIEF, which fell 1.08 percent.\par \par \uc2 GLOBAL MARKETS\par \par \uc2 Asian shares lurched to a 4-1/2 month low on Friday, extending the previous day's weakness as disappointing Chinese manufacturing data raised concerns over the economy, and investors sought safety in gold and the yen. The yen and Swiss franc held firm on Friday, having charged higher overnight as worries about a slowdown in China and turmoil in some emerging markets spurred demand for the safe-haven \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CENTRAL BANK INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's lira weakened to a further record low on Thursday, despite repeated direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  throughout the day. Earlier this week, the bank had shiwed away from hikint its main interest rates despite a tumbling lira and rising inflation.\par \par \uc2 FOREIGN ARRIVALS\par \par \uc2 Culture and Tourism ministry will announce the number of foreign arrivals for December and 2013 as a whole.\par \par \uc2 JUDICIAL COUNCIL BILL\par \par \uc2 Parliament's general assembly will continue debate on the draft law reforming the High Council of Judges and Prosecutors, which makes judicial appointments (1200 GMT).\par \par \uc2 \f2               \par               \par               \par               \par Note: For a list of forthcoming events, see.\par \par               \par For other related news, double click on:\par \par               \par Turkish politics\par \par               \par Turkish equities\par \par               \par Turkish money\par \par               \par Turkish debt\par \par               \par Turkish hot stocks\par \par               \par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  news\par \par               \par All emerging market news\par \par               \par All Turkish news\par \par               \par For real-time quotes, double click on:\par \par               \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Istanbul National-100 stock index, interbank lira trading, lira bond trading (Reporting by Ece Toksabay)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2014-1-27T06:24:58.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020140124ea1o006bt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
